Regression tests of the SML decoder (src/MeterData.h)

  pio test -e native

Runs on the host (no ESP32 needed). Uses libSML and Unity.

test_decoder/test_main.cpp   the tests
test_decoder/sml_vectors.h   a few frames per meter, GENERATED - do not edit
tools/make_vectors.py        cuts the frames out of the raw captures below

*.hex                        raw captures (stream of SML frames, hex text or binary), e.g. recorded on the raspi.
                             They contain no wall clock time; the only time is the meter's sensor time inside each frame.

Add a new meter / capture:
  1. put the capture in test/
  2. add it to VECTORS in tools/make_vectors.py (name, file, frame numbers), run  python3 test/tools/make_vectors.py
  3. add the expected values to test_decoder/test_main.cpp
